  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 18 * 90 * 3 * 27 * 8 = 0\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) ÷, −, ×, +\n\n18 * 90 * 3 * 27 * 8 = 0 ⇒ 18 ÷ 90 - 3 × 27 + 8 = 0\n\n⇒ __**18 ÷**____** 90**__ - 3 × 27 + 8 = 0\n\n⇒ 0.2 - __**3 **____**×**____** 27**__ + 8 = 0\n\n⇒ __**0.2**____** + 8**__ - 81 = 0\n\n⇒ __8.2** - 81**__ = 0\n\n⇒ -72.8 ≠ 0 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) −, ×, ÷, −\n\n18 * 90 * 3 * 27 * 8 = 0 ⇒ 18 - 90 × 3 ÷ 27 - 8 = 0\n\n⇒ 18 - 90 × __**3 ÷ 27**__ - 8 = 0\n\n⇒ 18 - __**90 × 0.11**__ - 8 = 0\n\n⇒ __**18 - 10 - 8**__ = 0\n\n**⇒ 0 = 0 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3) +, ×, −, ÷\n\n18 * 90 * 3 * 27 * 8 = 0 ⇒ 18 + 90 × 3 - 27 ÷ 8 = 0\n\n⇒ 18 + 90 × 3 - __**27 ÷ 8**__ = 0\n\n⇒ 18 + __**90 × 3**__ - 3.375 = 0\n\n⇒ __**18 + 270**__ - 3.375 = 0\n\n⇒ __288____** - 3.375**__ = 0\n\n⇒ 284.625 ≠ 0 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) ×, ÷, +, −\n\n18 * 90 * 3 * 27 * 8 = 0 ⇒ 18 × 90 ÷ 3 + 27 - 8 = 0\n\n⇒ 18 × __**90 ÷ 3**__ + 27 - 8 = 0\n\n⇒ __**18 × 30**__ + 27 - 8 = 0\n\n⇒ __**540 + 27**__ - 8 = 0\n\n⇒ __**567 - 8**__ = 0\n\n⇒ 559 ≠ 0 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
